Q: Which function gives memory back?
A: free | free()
Q: What does malloc return if it fails?
A: NULL
Q: Which function changes the size of an existing block?
A: realloc | realloc()
Q: What is it called when a program forgets to free memory? (two words)
A: memory leak | leak
```

